      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1904-09-10_WidnesExaminer_art0036" n="art0036">
        <p>The Examiner, Saturday, September 10, 1904.</p>
        <p>Total</p>
        <p>S&amp;NREY WERE MILLS V. GLAZEBURY.—PIayed on Saturday on the ground of the former and ended in a draw. Silcock and S3:ldoa batted well for the visitors. Score :</p>
