      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1904-09-10_WidnesExaminer_art0103" n="art0103">
        <p>Two examples of side. In position B Iside off a side cushion becomes check side</p>
        <p>*GDposite side cushion</p>
        <p>V e A\- a • • 11, • running off the</p>
