        <p>BATHING FATALITIES. Mr. George Barker, of Oxford, a graduate of the University, was drowned while bathing at Clarach Aberystwyth, on Saturday. Mr. Barker, who was Willa was a good swimmer. He was accompanied in tit water by a friend, but disappeared suddenly and witholci warning, and it is supposed that he had a fit. Fflsb° was recovered about four hours later. r A visitor named Gibson was drowned at 3.ar a on Sunday morning while bathing. He was aV° swimmer.</p>
